  steps:
    1. Pick 3 distinct colors for bg (7), top_bar, bottom_bar.
    2. Build output grid (16x16) with bars at rows 0 and H-1.
    3. Place 3-5 top-color objects touching row 1, 3-5 bottom-color objects
